e> de cada conta é o identificador usado para ver detalhes e comprar.</p><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="bg-muted/50 text-left text-muted-foreground"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Parâmetro</th><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Tipo</th><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border"><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">game</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">string (obrigatório)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Slug do jogo. Use GET /api/v1/games para a lista completa.</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">page</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">number</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Página atual. Padrão: 1.</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">perPage</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">number</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Itens por página (máx. 50). Padrão: 20.</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">priceFrom / priceTo</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">number</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Filtro de faixa de preço (BRL).</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">order</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">string</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Ordenação (ex.: price_asc, price_desc).</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gamepad2 lucide-gamepad-2 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-primary mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"></line><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y