class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">steam</code>.<code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">rocket-league</code> e<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">epic-games</code> compartilham o mesmo catálogo de contas Epic Games — Rocket League filtra apenas quem tem o jogo na biblioteca.</p></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-[oklch(0.18_0_0)]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border bg-card/50 px-2"><div class="flex"><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-b-2 border-primary text-foreground">cURL</button><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">Node.js</button><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">Python</button></div><button class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" aria-label="Copiar código"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copiar</button></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed"><code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">curl &quot;https://legasforn.com.br/api/v1/accounts?game=fortnite&amp;perPage=24&quot; \
