esposta é um status simplificado, sem expor nenhuma mensagem da origem.</p><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="bg-muted/50 text-left text-muted-foreground"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Parâmetro</th><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Tipo</th><th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border"><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">accountId</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">string</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">ID da conta a verificar (obrigatório).</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-foreground">game</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">string</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">Jogo da conta (opcional). Fortnite não tem verificação automática.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-[oklch(0.18_0_0)]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border bg-card/50 px-2"><div class="flex"><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-b-2 border-primary text-foreground">cURL</button><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">Node.js</button><button class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">Resposta</button></div><button class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" aria-label="Copiar código"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copiar</button></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed"><code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">curl -X POST &quot;https://legasforn.com.br/api/v1/verify&quot; \
